    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea and Fish</i> is a micro-horror RPG puzzle game with a strong narrative focus, containing minor elements of blood, violence, and dark themes. Players will control the protagonist as they navigate an unfamiliar environment, searching for a way to escape and uncover the truth behind the events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanhai<br>The female protagonist of the game, a high school student at a private academy. For unknown reasons, she has been kidnapped and taken to an unfamiliar place.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583800/extras/6cc8cae5fee3f8508bc903d0f5cbfbd5.avif?t=1750346521\" width=400 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and adorable pixel art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with moderate difficulty, allowing players to fully immerse themselves in the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective is to collect 5 &quot;Memory Pearls,&quot; and gathering all of them will lead to the game's only ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Length\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 30 minutes to reach the single ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Controls\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space / Z / Enter: Confirm / Investigate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc / X: Cancel / Open menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift + Arrow keys: Run</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea and Fish</i> is a micro-horror RPG puzzle game with a strong narrative focus, containing minor elements of blood, violence, and dark themes. Players will control the protagonist as they navigate an unfamiliar environment, searching for a way to escape and uncover the truth behind the events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanhai<br>The female protagonist of the game, a high school student at a private academy. For unknown reasons, she has been kidnapped and taken to an unfamiliar place.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583800/extras/6cc8cae5fee3f8508bc903d0f5cbfbd5.avif?t=1750346521\" width=400 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and adorable pixel art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with moderate difficulty, allowing players to fully immerse themselves in the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective is to collect 5 &quot;Memory Pearls,&quot; and gathering all of them will lead to the game's only ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Length\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 30 minutes to reach the single ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Controls\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space / Z / Enter: Confirm / Investigate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc / X: Cancel / Open menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift + Arrow keys: Run</p></li></ul>",
